        {"zh": "我的螯比你胳膊长", "en": "My claws are longer than your arm."},
        {"zh": "你别把手伸进泥里", "en": "Do not put your hand in the mud."},
        {"zh": "我看着你，你看着水里", "en": "I watch you, you watch the water."},
        {"zh": "我的尾巴还有一根刺", "en": "There is still a sting on my tail."},
        {"zh": "你退到岸上就好", "en": "Stay up on the bank."},
        {"zh": "水面分开一条线", "en": "The surface parts in a line."},
        {"zh": "你听见壳裂的声音了吗", "en": "Do you hear the shell crunch?"},
        {"zh": "我在泥里待得太久", "en": "I have been in the mud too long."},
        {"zh": "你要下水吗", "en": "Are you coming into the water?"}
